From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: PureGero <puregero@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 15 Nov 2021 20:30:35 +1000
Subject: [PATCH] Add player syncing between servers

Sync players between servers: register players with the master server on
join, notify external servers when players disconnect, change dimension,
respawn or change gamemode, and suppress kick events and entity packets
for external players.

